g these beautiful yet challenging landscapes in Albatroz can make you pass out if you lack the necessary supplies, so be sure to gather them whenever you get a chance. As you progress, these demanding environments will get increasingly more challenging, requiring you to employ thoughtful management of resources by considering the items you carry, using them efficiently and only when necessary, and stocking up new items before they run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171880/extras/9d2389fb25a282543cb84b3947a2cf0c.poster.avif?t=1751535450\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171880/extras/9d2389fb25a282543cb84b3947a2cf0c.webm?t=1751535450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171880/extras/9d2389fb25a282543cb84b3947a2cf0c.mp4?t=1751535450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enhance your adventure skills </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character in Albatroz possesses unique adventure skills. These skills are presented in their Skill Tree and can be upgraded from Tier 1 to Tier 3. As players navigate the world of Albatroz, uncovering new areas, interacting with objects, and assisting NPCs with their problems, they will accumulate Travel Points. These points can be used to unlock Tiers in the Skill Tree and level up your car, making the journey more manageable.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow a deep narrative with captivating characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet new friends and discover new cultures in a quest for self-discovery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through beautiful and mysterious locations as you walk and drive through vast landscapes and face the wilderness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage resources, make travel plans, and improve your abilities in order to survive</p></li></ul>",
